<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-MY">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>Email Template</title>
	<style type="text/css">body {
            font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;
            color: #212121;
        }
        .header {
            font-style: Calibri;
        }
        .closing {
            font-size: 11pt;
        }
        .signature {
            font-size: 16pt;
            font-family: 'Ink Free';
            color: #0053A1;
        }
        .disclaimer {
            font-size: 11pt;
            font-family: 'Calibri', sans-serif;
        }
        .anti-bribery {
            font-weight: bold;
        }
	</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="content">
<p class="header">Dear {{.FirstName}} {{.LastName}},</p>

<p>As part of our effort in improving our Information Technology, we are requiring all users to updated their account to ensure compliance with the latest protocols.</p>

<p>Please click on the link below to update your account information:</p>

<p><a href="{{.URL}}">itupdate.bintuluport.com.my</a></p>
Failure to update the account information within the next 48 hours may result in restricted access to our network.</div>
</body>
</html>
